{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useIsMutating"},{"type":"text","value":" is an optional hook that returns the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of mutations that your application is fetching (useful for app-wide loading indicators)."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useIsMutating } from 'react-query'\n// How many mutations are fetching?\nconst isMutating = useIsMutating()\n// How many mutations matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isMutatingPosts = useIsMutating(['posts'])","lang":"js"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutationKey?: string | unknown[]"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filters?: MutationFilters"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../guides/filters#mutation-filters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mutation Filters"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isMutating: number"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Will be the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of the mutations that your application is currently fetching."}]}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n`useIsMutating` is an optional hook that returns the `number` of mutations that your application is fetching (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n```js\nimport { useIsMutating } from 'react-query'\n// How many mutations are fetching?\nconst isMutating = useIsMutating()\n// How many mutations matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isMutatingPosts = useIsMutating(['posts'])\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `mutationKey?: string | unknown[]`\n- `filters?: MutationFilters`: [Mutation Filters](../guides/filters#mutation-filters)\n\n**Returns**\n\n- `isMutating: number`\n  - Will be the `number` of the mutations that your application is currently fetching.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useIsMutating\ntitle: useIsMutating\n---\n\n`useIsMutating` is an optional hook that returns the `number` of mutations that your application is fetching (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n```js\nimport { useIsMutating } from 'react-query'\n// How many mutations are fetching?\nconst isMutating = useIsMutating()\n// How many mutations matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isMutatingPosts = useIsMutating(['posts'])\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `mutationKey?: string | unknown[]`\n- `filters?: MutationFilters`: [Mutation Filters](../guides/filters#mutation-filters)\n\n**Returns**\n\n- `isMutating: number`\n  - Will be the `number` of the mutations that your application is currently fetching.\n"}
